0..73 Comment "// What a method answering a place may not be: a method at a deduced mode"
74..150 Comment "// answers a view of its receiver at that mode and ends in the place itself,"
151..230 Comment "// its view type stands only as such a method\'s result, and its element type is"
231..304 Comment "// the element\'s. A view block follows only a call of such a method, on a"
305..379 Comment "// receiver a hold holds, and its exclusive lend waits for the held list\'s"
380..402 Comment "// other lends to end."
